Yes. **That is the correct direction for the final architecture.** We should not have only a few job-board connectors. We should build a **multi-source job discovery engine** where every source is checked for fresh jobs/posts, then everything goes through the same filtering, scoring, resume-tailoring, application and reporting pipeline.

One important distinction: we should call these **source connectors**, but not assume every website can legally or technically be scraped. Some platforms explicitly prohibit automated scraping—for example, LinkedIn prohibits unauthorized scraping/automated access, Freshersworld prohibits automated agents used to mine data, and Hirist says it uses technology to exclude robots and prohibits circumventing it. ([LinkedIn][1])

So our connector framework should support **official APIs, permitted feeds/public endpoints, authorized integrations, and other sources where automated access is allowed**, rather than trying to bypass firewalls/CAPTCHAs.

## 1. Final source architecture

We should have:

```text
                    AI JOB AGENT
                         |
                 SEARCH MANAGER
                         |
        +----------------+----------------+
        |                |                |
        v                v                v
   GLOBAL REMOTE     INDIAN JOB       RECRUITER
     SOURCES          PORTALS           POSTS
        |                |                |
        +----------------+----------------+
                         |
                         v
                  JOB NORMALIZER
                         |
                         v
                  DUPLICATE CHECK
                         |
                         v
                  TODAY FILTER
                         |
                         v
               EXPERIENCE ANALYZER
                         |
                         v
                    ROLE MATCHER
                         |
                         v
                   SKILL MATCHER
                         |
                         v
                  RESUME SCORER
                         |
                         v
                 QUALIFIED JOBS
                         |
              +----------+----------+
              |                     |
              v                     v
       APPLICATION LINK       RECRUITER EMAIL
              |                     |
              |               RESUME TAILOR
              |                     |
              |               EMAIL GENERATE
              |                     |
              |                 SEND EMAIL
              |                     |
              +----------+----------+
                         |
                         v
                  APPLICATION LOG
                         |
                         v
                  EXCEL REPORT
                         |
                         v
                     YOUR EMAIL
```

