# 4. Don't hard-code everything into SearchManager

This is where I want to improve our previous design.

Instead of:

```text
SearchManager
    |
    ├── RemoteOK
    ├── Wellfound
    ├── Naukri
    ├── Foundit
    └── ...
```

we use:

```text
SearchManager
       |
       v
ConnectorRegistry
       |
       +---- RemoteOK
       +---- Wellfound
       +---- YC
       +---- Indeed
       +---- Naukri
       +---- Foundit
       +---- Hirist
       +---- Cutshort
       +---- Freshersworld
       +---- Company Careers
       +---- Recruiter Posts
```

That means adding a new source later doesn't require rewriting SearchManager.

---

# 5. Your registry becomes extremely important

Your existing:

```python
CONNECTORS = {}


def register_connector(connector_class):
    CONNECTORS[
        connector_class.connector_name
    ] = connector_class

    return connector_class
```

is the foundation.

Eventually:

```text
CONNECTORS

remoteok
wellfound
ycombinator
indeed
naukri
foundit
shine
hirist
cutshort
freshersworld
company_careers
```

will be registered.

