# 17. Then application path depends on source

This is another major improvement.

```text
                         QUALIFIED JOB
                              |
            +-----------------+----------------+
            |                 |                |
            v                 v                v
        APPLY URL        RECRUITER EMAIL    API APPLY
            |                 |                |
            v                 v                v
       APPLICATION       EMAIL SERVICE      API SERVICE
         SERVICE
```

For example:

```text
Company career page
        ↓
Application URL
        ↓
Playwright/manual-assisted application
```

if automation is permitted.

For a recruiter post:

```text
Recruiter email
        ↓
Tailored resume
        ↓
Email
```

For a source with an authorized application API:

```text
API
 ↓
Apply
```

