# 18. Six-hour scheduler

Your final requirement is:

> every 6 hours

So:

```text
00:00
06:00
12:00
18:00
```

or relative to the agent's configured timezone.

Every run:

```text
START
 ↓
Load Career Profile
 ↓
Load enabled connectors
 ↓
Run connectors concurrently
 ↓
Collect jobs
 ↓
Normalize
 ↓
Deduplicate
 ↓
TODAY FILTER
 ↓
EXPERIENCE FILTER
 ↓
ROLE FILTER
 ↓
SKILL MATCH
 ↓
SCORE
 ↓
Tailor resumes
 ↓
Application/Email
 ↓
Log everything
 ↓
Generate Excel
 ↓
Send report
 ↓
END
```

